      "writtenOn": "2020-04-02T19:32:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m uncertain why \"pe\" has been the historical name of choice.  It definitely conflicts with the v2 PE layer naming.  \"pd\" would be a conflict with old stack... how do you feel about \"ami\" for \"alternate mode info\"? And a similar re-naming of pd_get_am_policy to pd_get_am_info?",
